# Blooming Blast's "that creature's controller" is the controller, not the owner. Bot2's Lightning Bolt aims at Bot1; Bot1 answers with Sudden Substitution, trading the Bolt for
# its own Ornithopter (CR 701.12), and aims the Bolt it now controls at Bot2. Bot1 then casts Blooming Blast, promising the gift, at the Ornithopter, which Bot1 owns and Bot2
# controls: Bot2 creates the Treasure, the Ornithopter dies, and the 3 damage goes to Bot2, not to Bot1. Bot2 is at 20 - 3 - 3 (the Bolt) = 14 and Bot1 untouched at 20.

